-- title:
--   Infinite-activity original positive-clock stopped dividend reward expected HJB upper with L1
-- statement:
--   For the original infinite-activity Lévy source, unbounded variation, arbitrary cap, bounded physical ruin stopping time, post-dividend stopped terminal, and inclusive stopped Stieltjes cash, the total discounted reward Term+Cash is L1-integrable. The positive clock event is measurable and its expected total reward, restricted to that event, is at most w(x) times the event probability. This is the genuine stochastic Itô–Meyer/HJB expected-value budget, with all original source assumptions unchanged and no martingale witness invented.
-- source:
--   Exact original infinite-activity source of root-child 12894389-6a1a-4166-893e-0157c9d0cff0; expected HJB bound with L1 is the genuine obstacle. Proved c584627c-f2aa-4cfa-a212-e6c3d4d4d2a5 converts positive-clock event mean budget into a centered supported martingale witness; no additional moments or source properties.

